  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Deployed in 60+ countries with over 15 years of production use — the reference open-source EMR for LMIC and global health deployments. Foundation-governed (OpenMRS Inc.), MPL-2.0, with an active global community and two maintained streams: the stable 2.x platform and the modern 3.x/O3 microfrontend architecture. FHIR R4 available via openmrs-module-fhir2. Complements OpenEMR in the MACH catalog: OpenMRS is the reference for LMIC and modular concept-driven deployments; OpenEMR is the reference for US practice management and ONC compliance.",
